         ldy.a vcs_standard_playfield-48+4*12+45-0
         sty PF2 ;3
         ldy.a vcs_standard_playfield-48+4*12+47
         sty PF1 ; possibly too early?
         ldy.a vcs_standard_playfield-48+4*12+46-0
